Downsample (Design B):

```dart
  /// 分桶平均降采样：每桶取均值，首尾样本原值保留，
  /// 输出长度 ≤ [maxN]。
  ///
  /// 首尾各占一个单点桶：曲线必须从第一个真实样本起、落到最后一个
  /// 真实样本上，否则尾段会被吞掉，看起来像「回放没画完」。
  /// 中间等分成 maxN-2 个桶，桶内均值抗抖；桶边界用整数除法对齐，
  /// 保证不漏样本、不越界。
  static List<double> downsample(List<double> src, int maxN) {
    final n = src.length;
    if (n == 0 || maxN <= 0) return const [];
    if (n <= maxN) return List<double>.of(src);
    if (maxN == 1) return <double>[src.first];
    final out = List<double>.filled(maxN, 0);
    out[0] = src[0];
    out[maxN - 1] = src[n - 1];
    final buckets = maxN - 2;
    final inner = n - 2;
    for (var b = 0; b < buckets; b++) {
      final lo = 1 + b * inner ~/ buckets;
      final hi = 1 + (b + 1) * inner ~/ buckets;
      var sum = 0.0;
      for (var i = lo; i < hi; i++) {
        sum += src[i];
      }
      out[b + 1] = sum / (hi - lo);
    }
    return out;
  }
```

